[Music]  over three years ago disney decided to  cut ties with its renowned director  james gunn after some controversial  tweets in retrospect it turned out that  many responsible people were disregarded  in this decision and above all it became  apparent that the guardians of the  galaxy franchise would be better off  with james gunn after all meanwhile gunn  joined rival dc and filmed the suicide  squad while disney tried hard to bring  gun back for guardians of the galaxy vol  3. since then quite a bit has happened  for despite the pandemic a great deal of  work has been done on the third part of  the past few months a few days ago james  gunn finally revealed on twitter that  filming of guardians of the galaxy 3 had  begun appropriately gun published a  small emotional message and a photo of  the main cast in addition to the  director you can see chris pratt palm  clementine zoe saldanas dave bautista  karen gillian sean gunn as well as  chukwudi iwuji who you know from guns  peacemaker series  besides there is one newcomer who is not  visible in the picture and that is will  polter the 20 year old will play the  role of adam warlock in the upcoming  part as has been known since recently we  hope for a trouble-free shooting and are  already looking forward to guardians of  the galaxy vol 3 which is scheduled for  release on may 5th 2023  bad news for star wars fans as reported  by the hollywood reporter those  responsible for star wars rogue squadron  will not be able to meet the production  schedule the main reason is director  patty jenkins who has yet to complete  her two major projects cleopatra and  wonder woman 3 first as if that were not  enough she is also simultaneously  working on a wonder woman spin-off about  the amazons originally the plan was to  let the filming of rogue squadron take  place between the shooting of wonder  woman 3 and cleopatra in the meantime  however they have realized that the time  window for star wars movie is far too  tight making the postponement the only  reasonable thing to do the original  release date of december 22nd 2023 is  still to remain important however rumor  has it that another star wars movie will  be released on this date instead this is  supposed to be the film by director jd  dillard and screenwriter matt owens  which was officially announced in early  2020. at least that's what some fans are  speculating which includes ruling out a  project by ryan johnson on that day due  to his involvement with the knives out  sequel dillard on the other hand has  practically completed his devotion  project and would in theory have time to  realize a star wars film soon the plot  could then take place in the age of the  high republic for example similar to the  upcoming series the acolyte of course it  should be noted that this is still pure  speculation since it's neither certain  which star wars film will take the place  of rogue squadron know what its plot  might look like  the play harry potter and the cursed  child has been a well-known name to many  fans for quite some time the idea of the  play comes from jk rowling jack thorne  and john tiffany and continues the story  of harry potter 19 years after the epic  battle against voldemort harry now works  in the magical law enforcement at the  ministry of magic and is a proud family  man his youngest child albus everest  name of course after the two famous  wizards suffers from being in the  spotlight all the time and is looking  for a way out of his father's shadow in  an interview with variety director chris  columbus talked about his desires to  bring the play to the big screen as well  he said that the actors of harry iran  and hermione are at the ideal age to  star in the cursed child he's referring  of course to daniel radcliffe rupert  grant and emma watson all of whom are in  their early 30s and that's only a few  years younger than their respective  characters in the story the idea of a  movie adaption certainly has its appeal  but there is one major problem with it  the play relies on time travel to  earlier events two characters who appear  in flashbacks are for example snape and  mcgonagall unfortunately alan rickman  has already passed away in 2016 and  maggie smith is 86 years old therefore  the question arises as to how an  appearance in the movie could be made  especially with snape they are likely to  scare off the entire fan base with both  a recasting or an insertion via modern  film technology what do you think of the  idea of a film adoption and what are  your thoughts on how it could be done  feel free to tell us in the comments  last thursday paramount announced that  two high quality films have been  significantly pushed back one of them is  transformers rise of the beasts the now  seventh part is directed by stephen  kippel jr and is set in brooklyn during  the 1990s unfortunately fans will now  have to wait much longer because as  those in charge have communicated rise  of the beast will no longer be released  in june 2022 but on june 9th 2023 the  same is true for the second paramount  film star track which is now scheduled  for release on december 22nd 2023 not  much is known yet in terms of content  and other than director matt jackman and  screenwriters josh friedman and cameron  squires no big names have been revealed  paramount's maneuver regarding the  postponement of star trek could actually  be related to disney's rescheduling of  rogue squadron because apparently those  involved are speculating that this time  frame is now free and thus they won't  have to release in direct competition  with a star wars movie on the theatrical  market regardless fans of both star trek  and transformers will have to remain  patient  vin diesel and dwayne johnson have had a  somewhat troubled past the two have  clashed on set more than once and  eventually the dispute even resulted in  the splitting of johnson's character  luke hopps into a spin-off of his own  additionally johnson announced he would  in no way return for the 10th fast and  furious installment on instagram diesel  now posted a picture of the two of them  with a fairly long text aimed at getting  johnson to reconsider his decision among  other things this talk of diesel's  children and their uncle dwayne sending  each other well wishes every holiday  moreover there is no other actor who  would be suitable for the role of lugops  according to diesel's own tone then  there are the reactions of the fans to  the post many rather johnson should pull  himself together one more time  especially for paul walker and the fast  and furious family one thing for sure is  that dwayne johnson is the highest paid  actor in the world and has no need  whatsoever to be starring in fast and  furious 10. diesel's attempts to get  johnson to return in this manner are  also kind of sneaky and only served to  turn fast and furious fans against  johnson should he decline the offer  there's still some time until the  release of fast and furious 10 on april  7 2023 but we still do not expect  johnson to be part of this film  the manga series one piece which has  been running since 1997 is one of the  most successful of its kind for some  time now it has been known that netflix  wants to tie in with the franchise's  great success by creating its own live  action series the official twitter  account provided us with a first  impression of the actors in accuracy  last tuesday in addition individual  portraits of the cast were published we  can see enyaki godoy who will play the  nation pirate king monkey d luffy he is  joined by mckenyu as swordsman rorona  zorro emily raddez navigator nami jacob  gibson as craftsman and sniper uzop and  tas skylar as well dressed chef zunji  expectations couldn't be higher given  the enormous popularity of one piece but  the first look at the cast seems  promising at least we can only hope that  this series doesn't follow in the  footsteps of the netflix movie death  note which was highly criticized by the  fan community unfortunately a release  date for the 10 episode series revolving  around the straw hat pirates is not yet  known  up to now fans of the science fiction  universe gundam have had to be satisfied  with only a little information about the  plan live action film adaption although  it is assumed that the adaption from  legendary will be very similar to the  original series more details are still  being kept under wraps at least there is  a first promising photo to admire the  concept art shows one of the many robots  that are controlled by humans and play  major role in this science fiction story  in the tv series humanity has long since  left for outer space where various  colonies have been formed eventually war  breaks out with the earth the initial  image wets the appetite for more even  though it's not entirely clear when  gundam will be released in any case it  has been decided that the movie will not  be shown in theaters it will only be  available via video on demand  and that's it for the latest news fans  of terrific creatures should definitely  not miss our latest original on jurassic  world dominion you can also find the  most recent clip for ghostbusters  afterlife and the first trailer for the  toy story spin-off light year on our  channel  [Music]  foreign

